00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.300
So the big question is, why AI?

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:25.800
Why now?

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.440
And the move from
descriptive analytics

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.450
to predictive
analytics is driven

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.890
by a maturity in AI technology.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:35.320
So this won't be new to
a lot of you in the room,

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:39.030
but as businesses are
evolving faster than ever,

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.610
data has to keep up and
deliver the insights

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.820
for those individuals
within the organizations

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.830
and bring that data
to the front lines

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:50.040
to help them make the decisions
as and when they are needed.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.560
And capitalizing
on data is not new.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.510
People have been doing
it throughout time.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:59.220
The difference now is that
this evolution of compute

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:02.820
and this evolution of scale
and speed and diversity

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.840
and the types of models
that are available

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.590
and the type of big
data technologies

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:11.040
that are available through
Google Cloud from a capture all

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.070
the way through storage,
processing and insights

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:17.370
perspective are pretty much
ready at this point in time

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.530
to help deliver those insights.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.790
It's not about
big or small data.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.760
It doesn't matter how
small the data set is.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.370
It's about how you leverage
it with the insight

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:29.070
from the industry for
the right use cases

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:33.860
to deliver value to those
individuals as well.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:38.320
And this is all about the move
from understanding or hindsight

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.320
through to insight.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:41.530
So how do you get
insight available

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.320
within your organization to
know where you need to work?

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.210
And the overall,
overarching aim is

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:49.660
getting to foresight where you
are able to go and do things

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:52.067
before they occur.

00:16:52.067 --> 00:16:53.650
We've all seen
Minority Report, right?

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:01.540
And just to touch on this
