00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:05.680
Hitachi has deep experience
within the Maintenance world.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:09.430
Hitachi has deep experience
within the IoT world as well.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:12.670
So we are able to leverage
not just the AI components

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.180
