with our clients,

00:42:00.030 --> 00:42:04.510
so Fleet Optimization
is a continual effort.

00:42:04.510 --> 00:42:06.755
So it's about understanding
what you want to do,

00:42:06.755 --> 00:42:08.130
where you want to
do it, and what

00:42:08.130 --> 00:42:11.060
you want to try and improve
from a use case perspective.

00:42:11.060 --> 00:42:13.240
So AC breaks with the
start, and our clients

00:42:13.240 --> 00:42:14.940
now learning all
the other things

00:42:14.940 --> 00:42:17.850
that they might want to
do based on the data we've

00:42:17.850 --> 00:42:20.990
been able to pull up
and surface for them.

00:42:20.990 --> 00:42:22.740
Data isn't enough.

00:42:22.740 --> 00:42:25.910
So the key point is as much
data as you can bring back

00:42:25.910 --> 00:42:26.640
isn't enough.

00:42:26.640 --> 00:42:29.360
You need to combine that data
with contextual information

00:42:29.360 --> 00:42:31.520
but also with that
subject matter

00:42:31.520 --> 00:42:35.330
expertise and the ability
