00:43:23.620 --> 00:43:27.450
but also robust and
powerful visualization tools

00:43:27.450 --> 00:43:31.080
to help provide the
information for that end user

00:43:31.080 --> 00:43:32.910
to help them complete their job.

00:43:32.910 --> 00:43:36.330
So for example, when we were
